    "title": "Hailey Bieber stuns in yellow mini at Coachella before Justin’s headline show | HELLO!",
    "text": "HomeUSThe Rhode founder brought effortless desert glamor to day two of Coachella as she stepped out in style just hours before husband Justin Bieber takes to the stage© WireImage 4 days agoApr 12, 2026, 5:19 AM GMT+1 Hailey Bieber made sure all eyes were on her as she stepped out in style at day two of the 2026 Coachella Festival – just hours before husband Justin Bieber was set to take to the main stage.The 29-year-old model and beauty mogul looked effortlessly chic as she hosted the exclusive Rhode World pop-up at the festival grounds in Indio, California, where invited guests gathered to celebrate her wildly successful skincare brand, Rhode.© InstagramMellow yellowFor the occasion, Hailey slipped into a spring-ready canary yellow mini dress with striking purple splatter-print trim, giving the look a playful festival edge. The slinky silhouette skimmed her figure, while the soft bias-cut neckline added an elegant touch.Wearing her glossy caramel hair loose in soft waves, Hailey kept her beauty look fresh and glowing, with bronzed skin and subtle makeup enhancing her signature radiant complexion.© InstagramHanging with friendsIn photos shared on social media, Hailey beamed as she stood at the Rhode World booth, flashing a cheerful thumbs-up while posing for a snap taken by Rhode president Lauren Ratner.The event quickly became one of the most coveted daytime hangouts at the festival, drawing a stylish guest list that included Brazilian model Marianne Fonseca, who is married to Drew Taggart from The Chainsmokers.© Instagram\"Stunningly beautiful\"Marianne later shared a series of photos from the event, including sweet snaps with Hailey, and gushed over the star in Portuguese, writing: \"Linda de viver,\" which translates to \"stunningly beautiful.\"Hailey’s polished Coachella appearance comes amid a particularly exciting weekend for the Bieber household, with Justin preparing to deliver one of the festival’s most anticipated headline performances.© InstagramBig weekendJustin is set to take the Saturday headline slot across both Coachella weekends, in a blockbuster deal reportedly worth more than $10 million.Power coupleJustin’s return to the Coachella stage marks another major milestone in his comeback to live performance. Earlier this year, he made a triumphant return to the 67th Annual Grammy Awards, delivering his first major live set since 2022.While Justin gears up for his big moment under the desert lights, Hailey has already proven she’s more than capable of stealing the spotlight herself – bringing fashion, business and star power to the festival long before the first note was sung.",
